OL,5,G1900 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,6,     FKazuki Yamada conducts the CBSO in
OL,7,     Fsea-related music by Bax, Debussy
OL,8,     Fand Anna Clyne. The orchestra is
OL,9,     Falso joined by Alice Sara Ott for
OL,10,     Fa performance of Grieg's Piano
OL,11,     FConcerto.
OL,12,G2145 The Essay: Coltrane's Sound
OL,13,     FLegendary jazz musician Archie
OL,14,     FShepp remembers his friend and
OL,15,     Fmentor John Coltrane. Presented by
OL,16,     FAshley Kahn.
OL,17,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,18,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,19,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,20,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,21,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,22,     Feverything in between.
